<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Chesapeake Energy rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chesapeake Energy rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--ABN Amro Chicago Corp said Friday it initiated coverage of Chesapeake Energy Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Its earnings per share estimates for the company are $0.83 for 1997 and $1.03 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Chesapeake Energy ended off 1/8 alt 21-1/2.</p>
<p>	 ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
